{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This package Huamnizes Kontakt #0016 Host parameter (should be assigned to Tune)\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles the bypass state for the first 12 FX slots (indices 0 to 11) on the selected track. If any of these FX are currently active, they will all be bypassed. If all of them are already bypassed, they will all be enabled.\par}
}

